message: >-
  If you use VASPBERRY 1.2.0, cite this repository and the scientific method
  references appropriate to the calculation you performed.
title: VASPBERRY
type: software
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-09-04
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Hyun-Jung
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5602-1404"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Infant83/VASPBERRY"
url: "https://github.com/Infant83/VASPBERRY"
abstract: >-
  VASPBERRY reads VASP WAVECAR wavefunctions to calculate Berry curvature,
  Chern numbers, a Fukui-Hatsugai n-field Z2 invariant, circular dichroism,
  and guarded energy- and valley-resolved Hall transport.
